{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"732867492040540210","content":"Leaf walks out in the open and takes a deep breath of evening air. She smiles, proud of herself for going into a bar for the first time, before her goblin eyes suddenly shine with recollection. She reaches into her dress pocket and pulls out the berry her friend Gill had given her the day before. After looking around for a promising spot, preferably away from too much foot traffic, Leaf sits cross legged on the ground and digs a hole in the dirt, before gently placing the now shriveled berry in the hole and covering it back up. She bends over and places her face close to the ground and says, \"May the Wild Mother and her patrons help you grow big and strong, so that someday after I've explored the new world, I can come visit you in the old one.\" The ground glows softly as the berry sprouts from the dirt. She sits here silently tending to the dirt and breathing in the fresh air for a bit, content with her new life. \n\n('Parking' here for a bit, I'll be back in a few)","created_at":"2020-07-20T06:50:46.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734663579088715786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
